test/type/wrong/assign-effect@kk(4, 8): type error: effects do not match
 context : i + (fn() { println("tick"); 1 })()
 term : i + (fn() { println("tick"); 1 })()
 inferred effect: <console|_e>
 expected effect: total
 because : the right-hand side must be total to update i in place; use `i ::= @@@` to assign a value using effects